<h2>Watch &amp; follow</h2>
<p>Every episode is on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@soundsofchannel">YouTube</a>, with clips on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/soundsof.aus/">Instagram</a> and <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@soundsof.aus">TikTok</a>.</p>
<p>I'm looking to continue the series back in Melbourne. Are you an artist, or know one, who'd suit the series? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
<p>And there are <a href="/interests/#travel">photos and videos from the road</a> too.</p>

